<div class="anh-slide uml"><img src="https://media.cuongthai.com/images/academy/SWD392/uml/363db2ee0567775e6898d849521bb0f39d443274.svg" alt="Gomaa Figure 7.11: Employee * — Works on — * Project, with the association class Hours hanging from the line by a dashed line" loading="lazy" /><p class="chu-thich">🧩 Gomaa Figure 7.11: Employee * — Works on — * Project, with the association class Hours hanging from the line by a dashed line</p></div>
