<tr><td>UML nested decimal</td><td>one more level = sent <em>inside</em> the handling of the parent message (call nesting)</td><td>1, 1.1, 1.1.1, 1.2, 1.2.1</td><td>Fowler Fig. 12.2, tools like Visual Paradigm (slide 9, left)</td></tr>
